Cell["\<\
An oblivious ring machine has a circular tape and a list of steps that it \
uses in turn, whatever is on the tape. Each step replaces the first few \
symbols of the tape using rules, and then rotates the tape to the left by an \
offset.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->499487697,ExpressionUUID->"350e475c-a16a-5a40-a558-85a02a2d5cbe"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ring machine ",
